From 97f5f982b4e9a1243dd685ae23905f72e1cee995 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 07:56:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Harden and speed up the site: security headers, SEO
 structured data, lighter reader bundle

Security
- CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, nosniff, Referrer- and Permissions-Policy on
  every site page (vercel.json); the API keeps helmet.
- API refuses POST/PATCH/DELETE from other sites' pages (Origin check).
- Login takes the same time for unknown emails (no account probing).

SEO
- NewsArticle JSON-LD on story pages (both languages); Organization and
  WebSite (with search) JSON-LD in index.html.
- Server-side title/description/canonical/hreflang for section pages and /en.
- robots.txt served by the API with absolute sitemap URLs; search pages
  disallowed and marked noindex.
- English stories in the news sitemap, English sections in the sitemap,
  article:modified_time, RSS autodiscovery link.
- Canonical link kept right while reading in the app.

Performance
- Dashboard pages lazy-loaded: readers' main bundle 583 KB -> 479 KB.
- Fonts linked with preconnect instead of a CSS @import chain.
- srcset for Cloudinary/Pexels photos; the story photo loads first.
- og-image.psd (2.5 MB) moved out of the published folder.

Accessibility: "skip to content" link.

